\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Recall reporting shell for the held out Cache2 evaluation. Panel A is reserved for human recall by reviewer group for RQ1; Panel B is reserved for recall under prompts corresponding to researchers without specialist expertise, qualitative methods experts, and domain experts from the primary frozen LLM reviewer snapshot for RQ2. Each point reports TP/N recall with its source-cluster bootstrap 95\% interval. Dreaddit role-by-flaw plots and additional model snapshots belong in the supplementary results. Points and intervals may be added only from the corresponding frozen real-corpus exports. No experimental results are reported.}}{7}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:role_sensitivity}{{2}{7}{Recall reporting shell for the held out Cache2 evaluation. Panel A is reserved for human recall by reviewer group for RQ1; Panel B is reserved for recall under prompts corresponding to researchers without specialist expertise, qualitative methods experts, and domain experts from the primary frozen LLM reviewer snapshot for RQ2. Each point reports TP/N recall with its source-cluster bootstrap 95\% interval. Dreaddit role-by-flaw plots and additional model snapshots belong in the supplementary results. Points and intervals may be added only from the corresponding frozen real-corpus exports. No experimental results are reported}{figure.caption.11}{}}
